(Authenticode-verified Microsoft distribution) together with the official
WebView2 SDK 1.0.4258.31. Microsoft's WebView2 Runtime license grants
distribution as part of an application; the verbatim terms travel inside the
vendor snapshot (WEBVIEW2-RUNTIME-LICENSE.txt in the browser archive) and are
retained in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/browser/. Chrome for Testing, Chromium headless
shell and Playwright FFmpeg are not bundled or distributed.

